{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"componentIndex","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Storages address their per-type state and the per-entity component bitset by this value.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The default implementation assigns indices lazily: the first access of a type takes the next free index","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the process, later accesses look it up in a thread-safe table. The index is process-wide, not per ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","isActive":true},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so all nexuses of a process agree on it. Indices are dense (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0 ..< n"},{"text":" for ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"n"},{"text":" types used so far) and unbounded.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"They depend on the order of first use and are not stable between process launches;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/RegistrableComponent\/stableIdentifier","isActive":true},{"text":" for persistent data.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift has no stored static properties in generic types, so a plain conformance can not cache its index in a static."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provide your own implementation (the "},{"code":"@Component","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" macro will) as a stored "},{"code":"static let","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for a plain load,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"but only if you can guarantee that two types never share an index and that it is in "},{"code":"0 ..< 1_048_576","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Indices are process-wide: a hand-assigned index must not collide with a lazily assigned one of another type."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A collision or an index out of range traps at first use of the type in a nexus."}]},{"style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"O(1)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Complexity","type":"aside"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The dense index of this component type."}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Property","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"componentIndex"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentPAAE14componentIndexSivpZ","title":"componentIndex","modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}],"extendedModule":"FirebladeECS"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component\/componentIndex-5oxlf","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component"]]},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/component\/componentindex-5oxlf"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swif